---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Journal" description="An open space for future research notes from Next Motion AI.">
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="journal-hero">
      <div class="container journal-grid">
        <div class="journal-intro">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> JOURNAL / OPEN SPACE</p>
          <h1>A space for what <em>we learn.</em></h1>
          <p>No research notes published yet. When our work reaches a point worth sharing, we’ll use this space for progress, methods, and the questions that emerge along the way.</p>
          <a class="text-link" href="/projects">Explore our first research focus <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="journal-canvas" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="journal-canvas-head"><span>FIELD NOTES</span><span>00 / —</span></div>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 500 390" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" focusable="false">
            <defs><linearGradient id="journal-wash" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#e3f0e6"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#d0e4e6"/></linearGradient></defs>
            <path d="M29 230c24-94 103-168 218-172 113-5 208 65 221 162 15 107-74 180-218 177C115 394 1 339 29 230Z" fill="url(#journal-wash)"/>
            <g fill="none" stroke="#6c9996" stroke-opacity=".28" stroke-width="1.2"><path d="M53 230C74 149 143 83 247 81c102-2 181 60 193 143 12 90-69 151-189 150C133 373 29 323 53 230Z"/><path d="M79 231c19-68 78-125 169-126 89-1 158 54 167 124 9 73-61 122-163 122-100 0-192-44-173-120Z"/><path d="M104 231c16-56 66-101 145-102 77-1 134 47 141 105 7 58-53 96-137 94-83-2-165-39-149-97Z"/><path d="M129 232c14-43 54-77 121-78 65-1 110 40 115 86 5 43-45 68-110 65-66-2-139-31-126-73Z"/><path d="M154 232c11-31 42-53 97-54 52-1 86 32 90 67 3 28-36 41-85 37-49-3-112-22-102-50Z"/></g>
            <path d="M72 331c63-48 101-65 148-60 51 5 89-22 130-75" fill="none" stroke="#50838c" stroke-opacity=".6" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-dasharray="2 7" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <circle cx="72" cy="331" r="4" fill="#50838c"/><circle cx="350" cy="196" r="5" fill="#438c7a"/>
          </svg>
          <div class="journal-canvas-foot"><span>OBSERVE</span><span>QUESTION</span><span>LEARN</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="journal-bottom">
      <div class="container journal-bottom-grid">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> IN THE MEANTIME</p>
        <p>Our research direction is taking shape. You can read about how we approach discovery, or get in touch to start a conversation.</p>
        <div><a class="text-link" href="/docs/who_we_are">Read our approach <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="mailto:contact@nextmotionai.com">Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
